OL,3,GNEWSAElection observation mission 'not
OL,4,Ainterference'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn election observation mission looking
OL,7,Fat the Isle of Man's general election
OL,8,Fis "definitely not interference", the
OL,9,Fhead of the delegation has said.
OL,11,FVoters on the island will get the
OL,12,Fchance to elect 24 members of the House
OL,13,Fof Keys to represent them across 12
OL,14,Fconstituencies in the contest on 24
OL,15,FSeptember.
OL,17,FOrganised by the Commonwealth
OL,18,FParliamentary Association British
OL,19,FIslands and Mediterranean Region (CPA
OL,20,FBIMR), the 10-strong team will be
OL,21,Fmonitoring the poll and gathering
OL,22,Fexperiences of those involved.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,448,445,260,140,0,100
