OL,3,GNEWSAElection observation mission 'not
OL,4,Ainterference'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead of the team, Deputy Chris Blin,
OL,7,Ffrom Guernsey, said: "We're not here to
OL,8,Fimpose or correct or change anything,
OL,9,Fwe are here to listen to understand
OL,10,Fwhat people think."
